$ and its **directed** boundary $∂Δ$ in the $uv$-plane, where $Δ$ is given by\n\n$$\nΔ={(u,v)\\,:\\,0\\le u\\le 1,\\,0\\le v\\le 1},\n$$\n\nand the transformation $T,$ given by\n\n$$\nT:(u,v)\\to (x(u,v),y(u,v)),\n$$\n\nwhere \n\n$$\nx=v-u,\\,y={v}^{3}+u.\n$$\n\nThe image of the side ${S}_{1}$ under the action of $T$ is a **directed** line segment. Find the endpoints of this segment, stated in the order that they are traversed."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186290414 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$(0,2)$ and $(1,1)$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186288207} {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$(0,1)$ and $(2,0)$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186288481} {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$(0,0)$ and $(1,2)$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186288535} {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$(0,2)$ and $(1,0)$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186289391} {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$(1,2)$ and $(0,0)$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186289498}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$(0,0)$ and $(1,2)$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186288535} :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186289925}] :question/math-academy-id "q-225036" :question/problem "![](images/33/33e48fa5bdbb034bcf489e038ccf80fc5f67baabeccacc1b7abd741183ebf05d.png)\n\nConsider the square region $Δ$ and its **directed** boundary $∂Δ$ in the $uv$-plane, where $Δ$ is given by\n\n$$\nΔ={(u,v)\\,:\\,0\\le u\\le 1,\\,0\\le v\\le 1},\n$$\n\nand the transformation $T,$ given by\n\n$$\nT:(u,v)\\to (x(u,v),y(u,v)),\n$$\n\nwhere \n\n$$\nx=u-{v}^{2},\\,y=2(u-v).\n$$\n\nThe image of the side ${S}_{1}$ under the action of $T$ is a **directed** line segment. Find the endpoints of this segment, stated in the order that they are traversed."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186290416 :question/answer-fields [{:ans